<title>FINLAND: NORVESTIA JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 12 PCT.</title>
<headline>NORVESTIA JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 12 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			    79.36 vs 70.95</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  10.82 vs 9.69</p>
<p> Net sales					 190.20 vs 171.30</p>
<p> Operating profit				 79.07 vs 70.75</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     79.12 vs 70.76</p>
<p> Net financial items		     gain  0.29 vs 0.21 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						22.23 vs 19.83</p>
<p> Net profit					 57.13 vs 51.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish investment company is Norvestia</p>
<p>Oy Ab.</p>
